    "crash_beats_mid_reascent_discounted": false,
    "interpretation": "MIXED \u2014 UNDISCOUNTED V5 returns: early crash \u226b reascent timeout (commitment \u2248 \u2212261 on V3-style ascents makes long aborts very costly). PPO-DISCOUNTED (\u03b3=0.99): distant timeout/commit is diluted, so mid-reascent discounted return can EXCEED crash (\u221212.9 > \u221278.3). Late crash collapse is therefore not fully explained by \u03b3-return preferring crash; the 11-D obs change and optimization dynamics remain confounded with the penalty. Land still best (+103)."
  },
